DECIMAL
0 VARIABLE MB
0 VARIABLE MW
0 VARIABLE MH
0 VARIABLE MP
0 VARIABLE MM
0 VARIABLE MC
0 VARIABLE MR
: MINIT MM ! MP ! MH ! MW ! MB ! ;
: MCELL MR ! MC !
MC @ MW @ U< MR @ MH @ U< AND
IF MR @ MW @ * MC @ + MB @ + 1
ELSE 0 0 THEN ;
: MGET MCELL IF C@ 1 ELSE DROP 0 0 THEN ;
: MSET ( DELIBERATELY BROKEN GUARD )
MCELL DUP 0= IF DROP DROP MB @ 1 THEN IF >R
DUP MM @ 1+ U< IF R> C! 1
ELSE DROP R> DROP 0 THEN
ELSE DROP DROP 0 THEN ;
: MFLAGS DUP MM @ 1+ U<
IF MP @ + C@ 1 ELSE DROP 0 0 THEN ;
: MXY DUP 0< IF DROP DROP 0 0 EXIT THEN
SWAP DUP 0< IF DROP DROP 0 0 EXIT THEN
8 / SWAP 8 / MGET ;
